f contempt of  Congress he would have the right to  defend himself including requesting  production of relevant emails and text  messages and calling them as witnesses  to demonstrate that their allegations  are false the official went further  saying the Deputy Attorney General quote  will further request the house general  counsel conduct an internal  investigation of these congressional  staffers conduct adding chairman Nunez  did not complain after the meeting at a  dinner with Rosen Stein and a mutual  friend in a statement of Fox News Nunez  said they take staff concerns seriously  and referred the matter to the speaker's  office a source close to the speaker  said they have encouraged the committee  to work through the Justice Department's  inspector general's office  Justice Department officials said no  formal complaint has been filed at this  time Chris Catherine thank you welcome
 

